    "description": "Comprehensive Postman test collection for 24MCAC302 MCA Sem III Advance Java Project.\nAuthor: ROSHAN NAMDEO BAGALE (Roll No: 50 | Div D).\nCovers all endpoints for Scheduling, Attendance, Digital SOAP Notes, and Adherence Analytics.",
